gpui: deliver external drags of data other than files (text, HTML, RTF, URLs, images)

Adds `ExternalData` (a platform's typed representations of a drag: type
identifiers while dragging, contents at the drop) and two `FileDropEvent`
variants, `DataEntered` and `DataSubmit`. The window turns them into the same
internal drag a file drop becomes, so `on_drop::<ExternalData>` and
`drag_over::<ExternalData>` work like their `ExternalPaths` counterparts.
`DataSubmit` replaces the drag's value with the dropped contents. Backends
that never emit the new variants behave as before.

